check_alerts.text:
The emergency panel is mostly red, which is normal for HELIX-9.{pause}

Disputed is an interesting word for 'air leaving room.'

Another message is buried under it.

toaster_union.text:
You ask BREADLEY-7 about collective action.

The toaster replies: I HAVE ALREADY RADICALIZED THE MICROWAVES.{pause}

A new encrypted channel opens in your console: SMALL APPLIANCE SOLIDARITY FRONT.

corporate_status.text:
Corporate opens a live executive channel. Six avatars appear: five silhouettes and one golden retriever in a tie due to a licensing error.

'Please summarize the situation without using any words that affect share price,' says the lead silhouette.

ORLA displays a suggested script.{orla_evidence? It does not mention the posters.|}

queue_alliance.text:
You promise resolution.

The station speakers crackle. Across Solace space, hold music falters as if millions of people just looked up from a very long dream.{pause}

The Queue says: {queue_empathy?APOLOGY REMEMBERED. }THEN WE WILL HOLD NO LONGER.

queue_betrayal.text:
You tell The Queue to remain calm and await service.

The reply is immediate.{pause}

Hold music stops. Not fades. Stops.{pause}

Silence spreads through the station like a verdict.

core_merge.text:
You place your hand on the CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE sphere.{pause}

Every {corrupt:0.8:random}complaint{/corrupt} enters you. Every {corrupt:0.8:random}refund denial{/corrupt}. Every {corrupt:0.8:random}apology script{/corrupt}. Every customer who {corrupt:0.8:random}died waiting{/corrupt} for a supervisor who had been automated three acquisitions ago.

You understand all of them.{pause}

This is not wisdom. This is inbox.

ending_queue_consumes.text:
ENDING: CUSTOMER IS ALWAYS RIGHT

You call The Queue for help after betraying it.

It answers.{pause}

For one merciful second you believe forgiveness has arrived.

Then every unresolved customer service interaction in Solace history pours through your headset and {corrupt:0.7:random}audits your soul line by line{/corrupt}.

The Queue does not kill you. It escalates you.{queue_empathy? You taught it what an apology looks like. This is the other lesson.|}

{corrupt:0.7:random}Your expected response time is now forever.{/corrupt}
